      "value": "Totally for it. As Oculus user, every time I log in a world, I must leave and come back again by rejoining friend, because Oculus + Seam VR got me latencies problems at first connexion in a new room.\nOn Invite only worlds it is a serious problem... And this idea would be a decent solution to this problem.",
