      "value": "@{58c6d558ff44e44ada717902|full_name}: You probably see it too, but I can't count the number of times people think respawning would fix an issue:\n\"Hmm, respawning didn't fix it\"\n\"No, you have to rejoin\"\n\"Oh, how do I do that\"\n\"Well, since we are in an invite+ instance and I'm not the owner, You need to leave and come back\"\n\"Oh, so go to another world?\"\n\"yes, go to another world, then wait for the API to update so it doesn't say you are still in the same world with me, then request a new invite from me and once I get it I'll send you an invite\"\n\nVs.\n\n\"Hmm, respawning didn't fix it\"\n\"Yeah, you need to click re-join not re-spawn\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
